# Gather the White Lotus counts the Plains its text names as it resolves (CR 612.2, 608.2h): Bot1 casts it and, in response,
# Magical Hack changes "Plains" in it to "Island". Bot1 controls a Plains and two Islands, so it makes two Ally tokens (one for
# each Island), not one (for the Plains), then scries 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Black Lotus
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Gather the White Lotus
Magical Hack
Island
Forest
Plains
Swamp
Mountain
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Gather the White Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Magical Hack.Cast(Gather the White Lotus)
Bot1.Modes(Plains)
Bot1.Modes(Island)
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Swamp; Mountain | )
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Island; Plains; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Ally Token; Ally Token
Bot1.Graveyard = Gather the White Lotus; Magical Hack; Black Lotus
